# format=FAST
# Fusion MS-WB670 at source 51, captured 2026-09-18 on a live bus.
#
# FUSION_SETTING id 74 "Volume Zone Sync" value semantics, named by the
# operator at the screen:
#
#   value 0 -> "Doghouse", which is zone index 0
#   value 1 -> "Saloon",   which is zone index 1
#   value 4 -> "All"       (the starting state)
#
# So the value is a zero-based zone index with a sentinel for "all zones", not
# a bitmask: a four-zone bitmask would be 0x0F = 15, not 4. What 4 derives from
# is NOT established -- this unit populates three zone slots, so it is not
# simply the zone count, and one device cannot distinguish the possibilities.
#
